# Input
```astro
---
// should not generate diagnostics
// biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette.
const classes = clsx("bg-pink-500");
---

<!-- biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette. -->
<div class="bg-pink-500"></div>

<div class={/* biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette. */
clsx("bg-pink-500", active && "text-red-500")}></div>

<div class:list={/* biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette. */
["bg-pink-500", { "text-red-500": active }]}></div>

{/* biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette. */}
<div class="bg-pink-500"></div>

{hidden && (
  // biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette.
  <div class={clsx("bg-pink-500", active && "text-red-500")}></div>
)}
{items.map(item => (
  // biome-ignore lint/nursery/noTailwindRawColors: This component displays the palette.
  <div class={{ "bg-pink-500": item.active }} />
))}

```
